Brand icons
The PNG artwork in public/brands is collected from community icon sets for proxy clients:
Koolson/Qure, Orz-3/mini, lige47/QuanX-icon-rule and Semporia/Hand-Painted-icon
(https://github.com/Koolson/Qure, https://github.com/Orz-3/mini,
https://github.com/lige47/QuanX-icon-rule, https://github.com/Semporia/Hand-Painted-icon).
Services those sets lack use the site's own favicon, fetched through Google's or DuckDuckGo's favicon
service at build time. The pack repositories state no licence; the logos remain the trademarks of
their owners and are shown only to identify the service a rule or connection refers to. tools/icons/packs.json and
src/ui/brands.json record where each file came from. Deleting public/brands removes them; the
UI then shows no icons and works unchanged.
